<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Extracted from the generated berkeley_humanoid_lite_dexhand.srdf, which
     was produced on a machine that had the off-repo 8-servo DexHand SRDF.
     Vendored so generate_srdf.py works from a fresh clone. The pairs are the
     DexHand Setup Assistant's own, computed against real mesh geometry.
     Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, as the rest of the vendored DexHand. -->
